1
00:00:39,795 --> 00:00:45,728
=My Loong=

2
00:00:46,035 --> 00:00:49,248
=Episode 17=

3
00:00:50,079 --> 00:00:50,799
(Yue Pharmacy)
Clear it out!

4
00:00:51,159 --> 00:00:51,840
Take everything back!

5
00:00:52,819 --> 00:00:53,472
Get in there!

6
00:00:57,203 --> 00:00:57,792
What's that?

7
00:01:02,479 --> 00:01:03,640
Xingyao! Uncle Fu!

8
00:01:04,319 --> 00:01:04,920
Are you hurt?

9
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:10,496
Lizhi,

10
00:01:11,799 --> 00:01:12,384
no.

11
00:01:12,959 --> 00:01:13,799
It's complicated.

12
00:01:13,959 --> 00:01:14,680
Don't fight yet.

13
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:50,159
Are these

14
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:51,000
enough?

15
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:53,359
These are luminous pearls
from the Eastern Sea!

16
00:01:53,879 --> 00:01:55,560
One of these
could last several lifetimes!

17
00:01:56,319 --> 00:01:57,959
Did he raid the Loong King's

18
00:01:57,959 --> 00:01:58,879
treasury?

19
00:02:00,159 --> 00:02:00,680
Master,

20
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,280
you're finally here.

21
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,519
As you can all see,

22
00:02:04,959 --> 00:02:05,760
our family

23
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:06,879
is not broke,

24
00:02:06,879 --> 00:02:07,920
and we won't default.

25
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:09,599
Please go on to register.

26
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:10,879
Once verified,

27
00:02:11,199 --> 00:02:12,080
we'll pay you all.

28
00:02:12,479 --> 00:02:13,439
Come register.

29
00:02:16,724 --> 00:02:17,312
Let's go.

30
00:02:18,323 --> 00:02:19,008
Hurry up.

31
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:20,064
This is wonderful.

32
00:02:21,439 --> 00:02:22,120
Master Lizhi,

33
00:02:22,479 --> 00:02:23,280
that move just now

34
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:24,680
was truly astonishing.

35
00:02:31,639 --> 00:02:32,439
Lizhi.

36
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:37,479
Well, young master,

37
00:02:37,879 --> 00:02:38,879
I bet you don't even know

38
00:02:39,199 --> 00:02:41,919
what Lady Wangshu is really capable of.

39
00:02:42,319 --> 00:02:44,919
She escaped the Loong Abyss alive

40
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:46,080
only because

41
00:02:46,599 --> 00:02:49,039
she serviced that old loong

42
00:02:49,039 --> 00:02:51,840
so thoroughly.

43
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,479
Old loong?

44
00:02:53,479 --> 00:02:56,479
That's how she barely survived
with half a broken body.

45
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,120
And look at you.

46
00:02:58,599 --> 00:03:00,280
You threw away so many treasures.

47
00:03:01,039 --> 00:03:03,719
So you're just a fool
picking up someone else's

48
00:03:04,159 --> 00:03:04,919
scraps?

49
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:07,840
You talk too much.

50
00:03:18,439 --> 00:03:19,080
Let's go.

51
00:03:20,639 --> 00:03:21,319
Lady Xingyao,

52
00:03:21,319 --> 00:03:22,280
who is this master?

53
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,879
I am the one who admires Wangshu.

54
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,520
I've come to ask for her hand.

55
00:03:30,719 --> 00:03:31,360
Lizhi,

56
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:32,919
what nonsense is this?

57
00:03:33,639 --> 00:03:34,439
It is no nonsense.

58
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:35,960
Today,

59
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,479
I present my betrothal gifts

60
00:03:38,039 --> 00:03:38,560
to marry you.

61
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:50,199
Look over there.

62
00:03:50,995 --> 00:03:51,636
So many people!

63
00:03:51,936 --> 00:03:52,480
What...

64
00:03:54,835 --> 00:03:55,520
Look!

65
00:03:59,599 --> 00:04:00,840
What a grand procession!

66
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,479
There's more! Look!

67
00:04:02,719 --> 00:04:04,000
Look! Over there too!

68
00:04:07,328 --> 00:04:11,904
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

69
00:04:13,919 --> 00:04:15,039
Look at those huge chests!

70
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:16,680
Dozens at least!

71
00:04:16,959 --> 00:04:17,560
Look!

72
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:18,759
The man leading up front

73
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,079
looks like an immortal!

74
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:21,519
He really does!

75
00:04:21,839 --> 00:04:22,879
There are more behind him!

76
00:04:23,552 --> 00:04:25,664
♪Refusing to forget♪

77
00:04:27,519 --> 00:04:28,199
(Tomorrow,)

78
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:31,360
will you act as my elder
to propose marriage?

79
00:04:32,279 --> 00:04:33,000
What did you say?

80
00:04:33,519 --> 00:04:34,112
Propose marriage.

81
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,240
Absurd!

82
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:37,240
The Cloud Steps will soon open.

83
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:40,560
That is our loong clan's return,
once in a thousand years.

84
00:04:40,879 --> 00:04:42,160
Do you truly intend to stay here

85
00:04:42,879 --> 00:04:45,519
and marry a mortal
whose life won't last a century?

86
00:04:47,072 --> 00:04:49,879
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

87
00:04:49,879 --> 00:04:50,800
Fine.

88
00:04:50,959 --> 00:04:52,120
If you're set on this,

89
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:53,319
I can't stop you.

90
00:04:54,199 --> 00:04:55,319
But I cannot do

91
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:57,720
what you ask of me.

92
00:04:58,439 --> 00:04:59,480
A thousand years with me,

93
00:05:02,319 --> 00:05:04,040
and I have long considered you family.

94
00:05:08,519 --> 00:05:09,040
Tomorrow,

95
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:12,199
I hope you will come.

96
00:05:13,792 --> 00:05:16,992
♪You are a drop of blood upon my heart♪

97
00:05:17,408 --> 00:05:20,544
♪I am a wound etched into your palm♪

98
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:23,120
My Lord,

99
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:25,839
what am I to do with you?

100
00:05:27,712 --> 00:05:30,528
♪Wind and snow bear witness,
this heart was not in vain♪

101
00:05:32,128 --> 00:05:33,760
Look at that! It's huge!

102
00:05:33,760 --> 00:05:35,232
What a grand display!

103
00:05:46,879 --> 00:05:47,839
I am Lanyuan,

104
00:05:47,959 --> 00:05:49,639
an elder of Lizhi's clan.

105
00:05:49,879 --> 00:05:51,240
Usually, I dwell in seclusion,

106
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,279
away from the world.

107
00:05:52,839 --> 00:05:55,000
Today, for our young master's betrothal,

108
00:05:56,079 --> 00:05:57,120
I have come to disturb you

109
00:05:58,560 --> 00:06:01,879
and propose marriage
to Lady Yue Wangshu on Lizhi's behalf.

110
00:06:11,759 --> 00:06:12,800
Look at that huge pearl!

111
00:06:12,959 --> 00:06:13,680
Right.

112
00:06:17,199 --> 00:06:17,959
What is that?

113
00:06:17,959 --> 00:06:19,680
I've never seen anything like that.

114
00:06:21,236 --> 00:06:22,199
There's more! Look!

115
00:06:22,199 --> 00:06:23,240
Lizhi.

116
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:24,032
- Jewels?
- Indeed.

117
00:06:24,032 --> 00:06:24,992
That's worth a fortune.

118
00:06:24,992 --> 00:06:25,696
- Never seen it.
- Me neither.

119
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:27,720
You'll have yours too.

120
00:06:36,224 --> 00:06:36,879
What's that?

121
00:06:36,879 --> 00:06:37,600
This...

122
00:06:41,439 --> 00:06:42,319
You want to kill me?

123
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:44,879
This dagger

124
00:06:45,399 --> 00:06:46,399
is exactly the same.

125
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:47,720
Though,

126
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:49,800
we won't need it anymore.

127
00:06:54,399 --> 00:06:55,360
Haichen Blooms?

128
00:06:56,759 --> 00:06:58,680
You had someone carve
so many identical ones?

129
00:07:00,279 --> 00:07:01,879
Where did you find the time
for all this?

130
00:07:02,879 --> 00:07:03,560
A proposal

131
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:04,800
requires care.

132
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:07,120
Silly loong.

133
00:07:07,959 --> 00:07:09,639
We are already like husband and wife.

134
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,160
Why bother proposing?

135
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:11,959
I know.

136
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,600
A mortal marriage

137
00:07:14,519 --> 00:07:15,439
is not a sacrifice

138
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:16,920
but an exchange of hearts,

139
00:07:17,959 --> 00:07:18,959
a vow before heaven, earth,

140
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:19,800
and loved ones.

141
00:07:20,279 --> 00:07:21,199
It is the most solemn

142
00:07:22,639 --> 00:07:23,720
promise a man can make

143
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,199
to the woman he loves.

144
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:27,319
Wangshu,

145
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,000
I owe you

146
00:07:29,519 --> 00:07:30,879
a true mortal wedding.

147
00:07:37,555 --> 00:07:39,360
Good for you two!

148
00:07:41,536 --> 00:07:42,816
- Wonderful!
- Great!

149
00:07:43,188 --> 00:07:43,796
Great!

150
00:07:44,019 --> 00:07:44,884
How sweet!

151
00:07:47,079 --> 00:07:48,360
What are you...

152
00:07:48,839 --> 00:07:49,472
Hold still.

153
00:07:58,720 --> 00:07:59,759
Haichen Blooms.

154
00:08:06,319 --> 00:08:07,480
It's Haichen Blooms.

155
00:08:09,079 --> 00:08:10,279
The Haichen Blooms are open.

156
00:08:11,959 --> 00:08:12,639
They're in bloom.

157
00:08:13,639 --> 00:08:14,720
When did they bloom?

158
00:08:14,839 --> 00:08:16,399
Back in the abyss, when I missed you,

159
00:08:16,639 --> 00:08:17,560
I planted them.

160
00:08:19,519 --> 00:08:20,800
I didn't know if they would grow,

161
00:08:22,079 --> 00:08:23,079
so I never told you.

162
00:08:49,519 --> 00:08:50,720
When did you return?

163
00:08:55,559 --> 00:08:57,159
I only left for a short while

164
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:58,759
to investigate

165
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:00,080
the sacrificial brides.

166
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:02,120
Lanyuan told me

167
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:03,279
that a century ago,

168
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,120
mortals feared the Li Fire

169
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:06,279
and craved peace,

170
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:08,519
so they staged the whole lie.

171
00:09:08,879 --> 00:09:11,480
It had nothing to do
with me or the loong clan.

172
00:09:13,159 --> 00:09:13,960
I knew nothing about

173
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:15,840
what happened to you.

174
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:18,480
Yet you suffered through it all.

175
00:09:24,879 --> 00:09:25,399
Wangshu,

176
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:28,279
I can't be without you.

177
00:09:29,559 --> 00:09:30,159
But

178
00:09:30,679 --> 00:09:31,679
I want to give you

179
00:09:32,039 --> 00:09:33,320
a fresh start of your choosing.

180
00:09:34,759 --> 00:09:36,039
I wish to stay in the mortal world.

181
00:09:36,639 --> 00:09:37,480
Will you accept me?

182
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:40,279
What did you say?

183
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,279
You're not going back?

184
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:44,480
Wherever you are

185
00:09:45,559 --> 00:09:46,399
is my home.

186
00:09:47,679 --> 00:09:48,360
Lizhi.

187
00:10:01,716 --> 00:10:04,000
(Prince Qi's Mansion)

188
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:11,080
Yue Lingluo,

189
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:13,159
as the mistress of this house,

190
00:10:13,559 --> 00:10:15,600
you live in luxury,
waited on hand and foot.

191
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,240
I gave you everything a noble lady

192
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:18,240
could ever want.

193
00:10:18,519 --> 00:10:19,120
Yet you...

194
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:23,039
You have cast aside all shame.

195
00:10:23,639 --> 00:10:24,440
Shame?

196
00:10:25,919 --> 00:10:27,519
Which shame do you mean, My Lord?

197
00:10:27,919 --> 00:10:30,039
The shame of sleeping alone
night after night?

198
00:10:30,279 --> 00:10:31,759
Or the shame of watching my husband

199
00:10:31,919 --> 00:10:34,080
pining day and night for another woman?

200
00:10:34,279 --> 00:10:35,360
What nonsense is this?

201
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:36,360
Nonsense?

202
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:37,720
Zhu Heng,

203
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:39,039
drop the act.

204
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:41,720
Do you dare deny

205
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:43,279
that you don't want a life with me

206
00:10:43,919 --> 00:10:45,720
because your heart
belongs to someone else?

207
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:47,639
Don't you know full well

208
00:10:47,919 --> 00:10:49,120
who lives in your heart?

209
00:10:50,639 --> 00:10:52,240
You sanctimonious hypocrite.

210
00:10:57,919 --> 00:10:59,320
You'd have me live like a widow,

211
00:10:59,679 --> 00:11:01,360
building a chastity monument

212
00:11:01,360 --> 00:11:02,799
for the woman you can never have.

213
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:03,879
I refuse!

214
00:11:04,519 --> 00:11:06,679
What do I need that monument for?

215
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:09,000
I won't spend my life
as a living corpse.

216
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:11,399
In fact,

217
00:11:12,519 --> 00:11:14,519
that monument suits you far better.

218
00:11:14,919 --> 00:11:17,679
Keeping yourself chaste
for your darling Wangshu.

219
00:11:18,159 --> 00:11:19,879
How touching, Young Lord!

220
00:11:20,559 --> 00:11:22,320
What a devoted romantic you are!

221
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:23,000
Shut up!

222
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:23,960
Stop!

223
00:11:27,639 --> 00:11:28,440
Father?

224
00:11:30,559 --> 00:11:31,519
How are you...

225
00:11:39,759 --> 00:11:42,919
I was holding down the fort
in the capital,

226
00:11:43,519 --> 00:11:45,159
leaving Daizhou to you

227
00:11:45,399 --> 00:11:47,000
to secure our rear.

228
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:48,200
And what happened?

229
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:51,080
Is this how you put my mind at ease?

230
00:11:51,399 --> 00:11:52,360
It is my failure.

231
00:11:53,159 --> 00:11:54,320
I failed to control my wife

232
00:11:55,039 --> 00:11:56,120
and maintain my household.

233
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:57,399
Do you think

234
00:11:57,399 --> 00:11:59,519
I rode day and night
just for the petty squabbles

235
00:11:59,679 --> 00:12:01,159
of your inner courtyard?

236
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:03,240
Then what brought you back, Father?

237
00:12:03,559 --> 00:12:04,879
What brought me back?

238
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:06,519
I should be asking you.

239
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:08,000
Yue Wangshu

240
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:10,559
was supposed to be dead
in the sacrifice.

241
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:12,879
How did she return from the Loong Abyss?

242
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:14,960
Yue Qiyang captured her,

243
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:16,399
yet how did he let her escape

244
00:12:16,639 --> 00:12:18,440
and end up half-dead himself?

245
00:12:18,919 --> 00:12:20,159
And that lawsuit

246
00:12:20,519 --> 00:12:21,600
handed the General's Manor

247
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:24,159
a crushing defeat.

248
00:12:24,159 --> 00:12:25,320
Tell me,

249
00:12:25,559 --> 00:12:27,840
what on earth happened in Daizhou?

250
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,000
Can't answer,

251
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:31,799
right?

252
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:34,399
Then I will find someone who can.

253
00:12:35,240 --> 00:12:36,000
Bring him in!

254
00:12:39,679 --> 00:12:40,279
Speak.

255
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:41,440
What really happened

256
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:43,720
on the day of the execution?

257
00:12:44,279 --> 00:12:45,200
Just who was it

258
00:12:45,759 --> 00:12:47,320
that rescued Yue Wangshu?

259
00:12:48,159 --> 00:12:50,360
Your Highness,

260
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:51,919
that day,

261
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:54,039
just as we were about to execute her,

262
00:12:54,559 --> 00:12:56,440
a strange omen appeared in the sky.

263
00:12:57,279 --> 00:13:00,519
A giant loong descended from above

264
00:13:00,919 --> 00:13:03,120
and carried Yue Wangshu away.

265
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:05,480
A giant loong?

266
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:07,799
How dare you spout nonsense
before my father?

267
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:08,879
Drag him out

268
00:13:08,879 --> 00:13:09,679
and execute him!

269
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:10,720
Hold on.

270
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:17,320
Raise your head.

271
00:13:17,519 --> 00:13:19,039
Tell me again

272
00:13:19,919 --> 00:13:21,200
what happened that day,

273
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:23,919
leaving out no detail.

274
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:32,679
Stop crying.

275
00:13:33,200 --> 00:13:34,360
You dared to do it.

276
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:35,799
So why panic now?

277
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:38,559
What if Prince Qi saw me?

278
00:13:38,720 --> 00:13:40,600
He knows everything.

279
00:13:40,600 --> 00:13:43,080
He will definitely
make Zhu Heng divorce me.

280
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:44,639
I had known

281
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:46,279
about Prince Qi's return.

282
00:13:46,480 --> 00:13:48,039
We had already spoken.

283
00:13:48,919 --> 00:13:50,679
He's back this time

284
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,279
for far greater matters.

285
00:13:52,519 --> 00:13:53,519
A little family scandal

286
00:13:53,759 --> 00:13:55,679
like yours is beneath his notice.

287
00:13:55,960 --> 00:13:57,919
But with Qiyang injured like that,

288
00:13:57,919 --> 00:14:00,200
what use is the Yue family to him now?

289
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:02,120
Do you think our ties
with Prince Qi's Mansion

290
00:14:02,399 --> 00:14:04,120
are merely marriage?

291
00:14:04,679 --> 00:14:07,679
We are all in the same boat.

292
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:12,480
Had Yue Wangshu's mother
not meddled back then

293
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:13,600
and ruined our grand design,

294
00:14:13,759 --> 00:14:16,399
who sits on the imperial throne today

295
00:14:17,159 --> 00:14:18,399
would still be anyone's guess.

296
00:14:19,159 --> 00:14:21,960
Wangshu's mother meddled?

297
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:24,879
Just old history.

298
00:14:25,519 --> 00:14:26,519
It doesn't matter now.

299
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:31,240
Let's see how much longer

300
00:14:31,879 --> 00:14:34,679
you can enjoy your carefree days.

301
00:14:38,644 --> 00:14:43,219
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

302
00:14:43,994 --> 00:14:48,491
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

303
00:14:51,730 --> 00:14:56,852
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

304
00:14:56,852 --> 00:15:00,191
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

305
00:15:00,191 --> 00:15:01,555
♪Refusing to forget♪

306
00:15:05,221 --> 00:15:09,998
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

307
00:15:10,549 --> 00:15:12,339
♪He cannot learn them♪

308
00:15:12,339 --> 00:15:15,474
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

309
00:15:18,626 --> 00:15:20,950
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

310
00:15:20,950 --> 00:15:23,313
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

311
00:15:23,891 --> 00:15:26,555
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

312
00:15:26,555 --> 00:15:28,313
♪Their days ahead are long♪
